      "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/netflix-games.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Looking for new iPhone and iPad games to play? The App Store has plenty of games without ads and in-app purchases.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Arcade is a <a href=\"https://apple.co/35ZjKQy\">great subscription option</a> for families, though it’s not the only game in town. If you’re a Netflix subscriber, you’re also paying for a huge catalog of great iPhone and iPad games.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apps,games\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1059196\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/06/youre-paying-for-80-iphone-and-ipad-games-through-netflix-heres-the-full-catalog/#more-1059196\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
