    {
      "id": 1788758404928,
      "title": "智界 R7 焕新款实车内饰首曝：双联屏确认、鸿蒙智行专属 HarmonyOS 车机、换装 HUD 抬头显示",
      "content": "<p data-vmark=\"c54c\">IT之家 9 月 7 日消息，博主 @未来的学习笔记 今日继续爆料，此次首曝了智界 R7 焕新款的实车内饰。</p><p data-vmark=\"8b3f\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/247fce21-a754-4c10-b650-08d7becb0bae.png\" w=\"798\" h=\"765\" data-weibo=\"0\" data-snap-from=\"%7B%22from%22%3A%22weibo%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fweibo.com%2F7874549549%2FRgYUZ6ztw%22%2C%22qualityMode%22%3A%22original%22%2C%22qualityValue%22%3A%22original%22%7D\" data-marks=\"1931fd9d012eb6d1dfbebfc7a89da886ea62ffe7c54f98137527fade83cd111d0d8179a9a499a137a0b40c63be19d7e7\" data-vmark=\"9e70\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"897f\">画面显示，<strong>智界 R7 焕新款用上了流媒体后视镜</strong>，手机无线充电板、杯架等设计有所调整，并在扶手箱与无线充电板中间区域<strong>新增了一枚多功能旋钮</strong>。同时，空调出风口也改为可手动调节。</p><p data-vmark=\"7b87\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/66154437-6c00-4f79-8b0e-a97ac9630de3.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"2196\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"c1d4\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/df7174f4-5e5a-411c-9d86-e531498cdb39.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"508f\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"2db4\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/bbd37238-308a-40fd-a624-f4fb2fa54a23.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"d029\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"1c43\">另外，<strong>新车换装双联屏，并把远端屏改为了 HUD 抬头显示，系统也升级了鸿蒙智行专属 HarmonyOS 车机</strong>；车内扬声器也有提升，配有四个天空音。</p><p data-vmark=\"d735\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/a3b332cb-465f-45ee-b77b-35945e14a8a0.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"1845\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"3bf1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/fdc1d9c8-0877-42b0-8d07-4a0f2b5b2bef.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"b103\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"267a\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/31dd4698-030e-43ae-9a4f-a52da673b76f.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"808f\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"954f\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/8921a2f9-818b-4661-a3e0-48c9da45c856.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"5d4f\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"81c2\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/d1e22a3a-c22b-445a-97e0-48d52c04a842.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"ae5b\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"7f3d\">IT之家注意到，博主还展示了智界 R7 焕新款的氛围灯部分。与前代不同的是，新款车型的氛围灯有了漫反射效果，可以在车内形成更具氛围感的光路。</p><p data-vmark=\"1530\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/59b6a947-8ae5-4e38-a91c-415575a0494f.png\" w=\"798\" h=\"765\" data-weibo=\"1\" data-marks=\"1931fd9d012eb6d1fdb102f5dcbb31daea367dcb7b74682a411997a449d6504d97f7aefb84a94aafae66815340d7344e\" data-snap-from=\"%7B%22from%22%3A%22weibo%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fweibo.com%2F7874549549%2FRgZnA3Jkm%22%2C%22qualityMode%22%3A%22original%22%2C%22qualityValue%22%3A%22original%22%7D\" data-vmark=\"b5b2\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"96c8\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/48a243bb-c599-4e3a-86a2-cde621a7051a.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"03fb\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"2fdf\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/82e098cc-d828-44d2-9c64-9a68fcf3b9ce.jpg\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-vmark=\"bc40\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"f506\">据IT之家此前报道，华为常务董事、产品投资评审委员会主任、终端 BG 董事长余承东 9 月 4 日宣布，<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ithome.com/0/998/266.htm\">全新智界 R7 本月开启预订</a>。</p><p data-vmark=\"8171\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/f88f8c78-9681-4e51-bde4-c99c7132fa80.png\" w=\"798\" h=\"1619\" data-vmark=\"c014\" data-mpos=\"2,0\"  data-snap-from=\"%7B%22from%22%3A%22weibo%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fweibo.com%2F1100856704%2FRgvPndfJm%22%2C%22qualityMode%22%3A%22original%22%2C%22qualityValue%22%3A%22original%22%7D\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p>",
      "pubTime": "Mon, 07 Sep 2026 04:52:55 GMT",
      "store": "其他",
      "links": [
        "https://www.ithome.com/0/999/214.htm"
      ],
      "source": "IT之家",
